  "path": "elements/qr-code.js",
  "docs": "# QR Code\n\n```html-preview\n<b-qr-code color=\"black\" size=\"100\" value=\"https://example.com\"></b-qr-code>\n```\n\n- Requires `qr-code-styling` package\n- Will lazy-load on first use of this element",
